{"steam_appid":604240,"steam_name":"Shotgun Farmers","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/604240/557866/7878a372ce8347e924cbaeb65f0e48d500dff582/1750561155/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742828637","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256941121/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1742828637","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/ss_198ac81087a835cd952c58e77acbc6de7b868699.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776188063","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/ss_535d0c8124bb5cac9348cff1b7594d3553ac6702.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776188063","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/ss_e8bbb15bfd22f83fb197fe4d71f1663742426450.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776188063","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/ss_8f6ee8251d8b384bd4237fe97f0a0d951754b48e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776188063","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/ss_fe6cfee7e97217927355e61059cc50bfdc284d24.1920x1080.jpg?t=1776188063"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shotgun Farmers</strong> is the multiplayer shooter where missed shots grow guns. Fire your bullets into the ground to plant your ammo. Reloading isn’t an option, so grab one of the deadly crops planted by the bullets of you and your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/456781b3219b6d9227cf5d4e38e4b240.poster.avif?t=1776188063\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/456781b3219b6d9227cf5d4e38e4b240.webm?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/456781b3219b6d9227cf5d4e38e4b240.mp4?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shot at by a sniper? Well they just planted you your very own sniper gun to fire back with!  Harvest weapon plants quickly for more ammo or let them grow for a larger clip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grocery-Filled Arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight with different vegetable weapons, grenades, and melee weapons, like the Carrocket Launcher and the Sniperagus Rifle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/308067518587824403498b2e43d91979.poster.avif?t=1776188063\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/308067518587824403498b2e43d91979.webm?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/308067518587824403498b2e43d91979.mp4?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multi-Farmer Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle enemy farmers in different game modes that change the way you play. Chase a chicken around the map in Chicken Run, steal the enemy’s prized pig in Capture The Pig, defend the scarecrow in King of the Crow, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/355b90ed673398bf24ace70693ad0c6f.poster.avif?t=1776188063\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/355b90ed673398bf24ace70693ad0c6f.webm?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/355b90ed673398bf24ace70693ad0c6f.mp4?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive The Horde</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle zombies in Horde Mode where you take on waves of infected farmers and animals. Can you survive to the end and take on the final boss?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/709735ac62d207255d7e383fdca5a936.poster.avif?t=1776188063\" width=616 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/709735ac62d207255d7e383fdca5a936.webm?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/604240/extras/709735ac62d207255d7e383fdca5a936.mp4?t=1776188063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie"],"developers":["Megastorm Games"],"publishers":["Megastorm Games"],"release_date":"8 Mar, 2019"}